          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi indi mirimo ya Salomo yose iyabanje n'iyaherutse, mbese ntiyanditswe mu by'umuhanuzi Natani no mu byahanuwe na Ahiya w'i Shilo, no mu byahishuriwe Ido bamenya kuri Yerobowamu mwene Nebati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Salomo amara ku ngoma imyaka mirongo ine i Yerusalemu, ategeka Abisirayeli bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Salomo aratanga asanga ba sekuruza, ahambwa mu mudugudu wa se Dawidi, maze umuhungu we Rehobowamu yima ingoma ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
